Subject: [PATCH v5 3/6] mfd: at91-usart: added mfd driver for usart
Date: Mon, 4 Jun 2018 19:59:40 +0300
Message-ID: <20180604165943.31381-4-radu.pirea@microchip.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.17.1
In-Reply-To: <20180604165943.31381-1-radu.pirea@microchip.com>
References: <20180604165943.31381-1-radu.pirea@microchip.com>
MIME-Version: 1.0
